+++ b/changelog.d/pr505.feature.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+All :command:`pysemver` subcommands now accept an optional leading ``v`` or ``V`` on version arguments (for example a git tag like ``v1.4.2``). The output is printed without the prefix.
