+Deprecate passing a :class:`dict` to :meth:`~semver.version.Version.compare`. It now emits a :class:`DeprecationWarning`; pass a :class:`str`, :class:`tuple`, :class:`list` or :class:`~semver.version.Version` instead (for example ``Version(**mydict)``). Other argument types are unchanged.
