+Deprecate the ``prerelease_token`` keyword of :meth:`~semver.version.Version.next_version` in favour of ``token``, matching :meth:`~semver.version.Version.bump_prerelease` and :meth:`~semver.version.Version.bump_build`. The old keyword still works but emits a :class:`DeprecationWarning`.
